  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Text>Text (+ / ++)</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Text>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Icon>Icon</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Icon>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Tip>How skill passion is shown: Text = append + (minor) / ++ (major) after the skill name; Icon = draw the vanilla passion icon. With Vanilla Skills Expanded, both styles automatically use its passion defs, supporting extra types such as apathy / natural / critical.</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionStyle_Tip>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterName>Passion icon after skill name</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterName>

  <BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterNameTip>Icon style only: when enabled, the passion icon is drawn to the right of the skill name (by default it is drawn to the left); the icon is skipped when the remaining bar width cannot fit it.</BetterInspectPane.PawnSkillPassionIconAfterNameTip>

